The Acme mark in this folder (public/images/mark.svg) is the example product's own artwork, drawn
for this template. A project made from the template replaces it with its own product mark, whose
rights are its owner's. The MIT licence of this package covers its code and stylesheets, not a
project's replacement mark.

The fonts the acme theme names (Geist, Geist Mono, IBM Plex Sans Arabic) are not in this package;
they ship in @stackra/tokens under the SIL Open Font License, with their licence texts beside the
font files.

The Stackra brand images are not in this package; they ship only in .github/assets/ under the terms
in .github/assets/NOTICE.
